WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.468
Video 16. Stock Summary ane baaki bills.

00:00:04.768 --> 00:00:13.100
Gateway par S dabaavo. Stock Summary ma darek stock
group no jaththo, rate ane value dekhaay chhe.

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:22.119
Enter thi group khule chhe. Silk Fabric ma (-)30.00
Mtr chhe. Tame stock karta vadhu vechyu.

00:00:22.149 --> 00:00:30.090
Item par Enter thi darek mahino dekhaay chhe.
October ma 180 Mtr bahaar gayu.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:35.973
Month par Enter thi voucher dekhaay chhe:
Joshi Stores ne Sales invoice 5.

00:00:37.066 --> 00:00:39.783
Stock ma 150 Mtr hatu.

00:00:39.713 --> 00:00:42.754
Invoice ma 180 Mtr vechaayu.

00:00:42.685 --> 00:00:50.451
Etle chopda ma (-)30 Mtr chhe. Stock gano,
athva baaki raheli purchase nondho.

00:00:50.751 --> 00:00:58.436
Alt+G dabaavo ane bills type karo. Go To ma
Bills Receivable ane Bills Payable male chhe.

00:00:58.466 --> 00:01:05.557
Darek baaki bill ma party, rakam, due date ane
ketla divas modu chhe te dekhaay chhe.

00:01:05.587 --> 00:01:11.696
F6 thi ageing chaalu thaay chhe. Be bills 90
divas thi juna chhe.

00:01:12.399 --> 00:01:22.782
Bill par Enter thi e party na badha bills dekhaay chhe.
Sharma Traders paase thi ₹75,392 levaana chhe.

00:01:22.812 --> 00:01:32.616
Esc, pachhi F5 thi Bills Payable: tamaare chukavvaana
bills. Bill MF/312 61 divas modu chhe.

00:01:33.096 --> 00:01:37.889
Aa j ageing chitra ma. Mota bhaag na paisa
nava chhe.

00:01:37.819 --> 00:01:45.579
₹81,810 90 divas thi juna chhe. Aa parties ne
pehla phone karo.

00:01:45.779 --> 00:01:50.138
Aagalno video: Print, Excel ane PDF.

